WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.790
I was the first spacecraft ever to circle another planet.

2
00:00:08.490 --> 00:00:12.910
When I arrived, a dust storm covered all of Mars.

3
00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:19.510
Only the tops of four giant volcanoes poked through. So I waited.

4
00:00:20.210 --> 00:00:28.090
When the dust cleared, I showed you canyons, dry riverbeds and the biggest volcano in the solar system.

5
00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:33.320
I arrived in a storm, and waited for the sky to clear.
